    "detailed_description": "<h1>BUZZ</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;This building-cleaning action game will change the way you interpret reality&quot; - <i>IGN Japan</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;A game that depicts the struggles of young people during their pursuit of their dreams&quot; - <i>Game*Spark</i></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dream-Chasing Window Cleaner x Action-Adventure</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a thrilling action-packed adventure as a window cleaner navigating the towering skyscrapers of the city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chase your dreams, face harsh realities, and carve out Sky\u2019s future.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Thrilling Cleaning Action</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilize wires and skills to swiftly and precisely clean buildings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But be careful\u2014one slip could lead to a deadly fall. Overcome hazards like birds, lightning strikes, strong winds, and many many more as you aim for top performance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387430/extras/68cf2af0fca2bfaebf6f3608a468bdad.poster.avif?t=1754300229\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387430/extras/68cf2af0fca2bfaebf6f3608a468bdad.webm?t=1754300229\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387430/extras/68cf2af0fca2bfaebf6f3608a468bdad.mp4?t=1754300229\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Manage Your Money and Well-being</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Taxes, rent, medical bills\u2014survive day by day while managing your limited income.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overworking takes a toll on your body. Rest and entertainment are key to maintaining balance in your daily life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387430/extras/ba07ec8cbe3b32aaf45e01fc9a4b9308.poster.avif?t=1754300229\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387430/extras/ba07ec8cbe3b32aaf45e01fc9a4b9308.webm?t=1754300229\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387430/extras/ba07ec8cbe3b32aaf45e01fc9a4b9308.mp4?t=1754300229\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Upgrade Skills &amp; Equipment</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enhance your cleaning tools and unlock abilities through the Skill Synapse skill tree.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build the optimal setup and clean more efficiently.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387430/extras/d052833b9d81f70f67c77ff688141079.poster.avif?t=1754300229\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387430/extras/d052833b9d81f70f67c77ff688141079.webm?t=1754300229\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387430/extras/d052833b9d81f70f67c77ff688141079.mp4?t=1754300229\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Sky\u2019s Life Changes with Your Choices</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story unfolds across five different scenarios, each with unique characters and settings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overcome challenges, interact with people, and help Sky find his true path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2014If you reach for the sky, one day you\u2019ll touch it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape Sky\u2019s future with your own hands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387430/extras/65e2f4cacc8dc823f97a23175da861ae.avif?t=1754300229\" /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dream-Chasing Window Cleaner x Action-Adventure</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a thrilling action-packed adventure as a window cleaner navigating the towering skyscrapers of the city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chase your dreams, face harsh realities, and carve out Sky\u2019s future.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Thrilling Cleaning Action</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilize wires and skills to swiftly and precisely clean buildings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But be careful\u2014one slip could lead to a deadly fall. Overcome hazards like birds, lightning strikes, strong winds, and many many more as you aim for top performance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387430/extras/68cf2af0fca2bfaebf6f3608a468bdad.poster.avif?t=1754300229\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387430/extras/68cf2af0fca2bfaebf6f3608a468bdad.webm?t=1754300229\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387430/extras/68cf2af0fca2bfaebf6f3608a468bdad.mp4?t=1754300229\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Manage Your Money and Well-being</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Taxes, rent, medical bills\u2014survive day by day while managing your limited income.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overworking takes a toll on your body. Rest and entertainment are key to maintaining balance in your daily life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387430/extras/ba07ec8cbe3b32aaf45e01fc9a4b9308.poster.avif?t=1754300229\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387430/extras/ba07ec8cbe3b32aaf45e01fc9a4b9308.webm?t=1754300229\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387430/extras/ba07ec8cbe3b32aaf45e01fc9a4b9308.mp4?t=1754300229\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Upgrade Skills &amp; Equipment</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enhance your cleaning tools and unlock abilities through the Skill Synapse skill tree.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build the optimal setup and clean more efficiently.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387430/extras/d052833b9d81f70f67c77ff688141079.poster.avif?t=1754300229\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387430/extras/d052833b9d81f70f67c77ff688141079.webm?t=1754300229\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387430/extras/d052833b9d81f70f67c77ff688141079.mp4?t=1754300229\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Sky\u2019s Life Changes with Your Choices</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story unfolds across five different scenarios, each with unique characters and settings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overcome challenges, interact with people, and help Sky find his true path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2014If you reach for the sky, one day you\u2019ll touch it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape Sky\u2019s future with your own hands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2387430/extras/65e2f4cacc8dc823f97a23175da861ae.avif?t=1754300229\" /></span></p>",
    "short_description": "SKY THE SCRAPER is an action-packed adventure about Sky, a young man who pursues his uncertain dreams while working as a building window cleaner. Through exciting wire action and daily life management, endure two months of hard living and pave the way for Sky's future.",
